@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFF9EE
skinparam defaultFontName Tahoma
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowColor #A54A2E
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFF9EE
skinparam classBorderColor #173A45
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F2E6D4
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #A54A2E
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F2E6D4
skinparam componentBorderColor #173A45
autonumber
actor Customer
boundary "React page" as UI
control "Customer Session API" as API
database "Session / grants" as DB
Customer -> UI : Scan QR with URL fragment
UI -> UI : Capture token and clear fragment
UI -> API : POST qr-exchange with token in body
API -> DB : Lock ACTIVE session; rotate QR\nStore credential hash and expiry
API --> UI : HttpOnly cookie + customer DTO
UI -> API : Read menu / place order with cookie
API -> DB : Verify hash, expiry and ACTIVE
API --> UI : Data of this session only
note over UI,DB : QR is exchanged once. Multiple devices use the next rotated QR.\nThe detailed sequence and error cases are in the appendix.
@enduml
